WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.069
Your business is running smoothly right where you are, but you've got a case, actually a lot of

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:13.000
cases for taking your business here, here, and of course, here.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.714
In this step, we will show you exactly how much easier it is to register and add offers across the

00:00:18.714 --> 00:00:21.000
world with the help of Amazon Global Selling.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.958
First, visit the sell globally page in your existing account and create a selling account in the

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:28.000
region in which you'd like to sell.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Now, you can track and manage your business across all regions in one place.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Next, review which of your current offers you want to feature in the new marketplaces.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Amazon provides a number of tools to help you manage your offers across regions, including setting

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
prices and translating offers into the right language.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.412
Congratulations!

00:00:47.412 --> 00:00:54.000
You're one step closer to selling across the world with the help of Amazon Global Selling.
